  "post_name": "estela-leon-garcia-ya-es-la-reina-infantil-de-suera-2015",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">(230 fotos) Suera ha iniciado este viernes sus fiestas, que se prolongar&aacute;n hasta el domingo 16 de agosto, con una gran variedad de actos preparados por la Comisi&oacute;n. el primero ha sido la proclamaci&oacute;n como reina infantil 2015 de Estela Le&oacute;n Garc&iacute;a.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_5095.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">La tarde se ha iniciado con el pasacalle para recoger a la Reina Infantil &nbsp;y Damas Infantiles&nbsp; entrantes, &nbsp;y a la Reina Infantil&nbsp; saliente,&nbsp;Denisa Neascu Nae<strong>,</strong>&nbsp;y a la Reina Mayor,&nbsp;Claudia Ortells Sorribes<strong>,&nbsp;</strong>a cargo de la Banda Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Suera.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">El acto de Proclamaci&oacute;n de la Reina Infantil 2015,&nbsp;Estela Le&oacute;n Garc&iacute;a,&nbsp;y su &nbsp;Corte de Honor, Alicia Sargsyam Serrano,<strong>&nbsp;</strong>acompa&ntilde;ada por&nbsp;Ismael Peris Casta&ntilde;,&nbsp;y&nbsp;Mireia Albalat Medrano, ha contado con Mar&iacute;a Jos&eacute; Serrano como mantenedora. </span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Al salir del sal&oacute;n, ha comenzado a caer una fina lluvia, que no ha impedido el retornodel pasacalles, mientras segu&iacute;a la animaci&oacute;n en los bares.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4867.jpg\" alt=\"img_4867\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4870.jpg\" alt=\"img_4870\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4871.jpg\" alt=\"img_4871\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4872.jpg\" alt=\"img_4872\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4874.jpg\" alt=\"img_4874\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4875.jpg\" alt=\"img_4875\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4876.jpg\" alt=\"img_4876\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4877.jpg\" alt=\"img_4877\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4878.jpg\" alt=\"img_4878\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4879.jpg\" alt=\"img_4879\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4880.jpg\" alt=\"img_4880\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinainfantilsuera15/img_4881.jpg\" alt=\"i